<br/>

<h2>An Example</h2>

\includeexample{vector3.cpp}

Output:

\prescreen
Vector 0, 0: 2	2	2	2	
Vector 0, 1: 3	3	3	3	3	
Vector 1, 0: 
Vector 1, 1: 
Vector 1, 2: 
